# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AUTH - Origin proof for cookie-based unsafe requests
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@OriginProofEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_EMAIL}}
@OriginProofPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_MECHANIC_PASSWORD}}


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### [Setup][Origin] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Origin] Login establishes auth cookies (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{OriginProofEmail}}",
  "password": "{{OriginProofPassword}}"
}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Origin] Safe authenticated validation does not require Origin (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Origin] Unsafe authenticated refresh accepts configured WebUI Origin (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Origin] Unsafe authenticated refresh rejects hostile Origin (403 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh
Origin: https://evil.example.test

?? status == 403

###

### [Negative][Origin] Unsafe authenticated logout rejects missing Origin (403 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

?? status == 403

###

### [Setup][Origin] Logout with the correct Origin (204 expected, cleanup)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

?? status == 204
